Bulreguard was invoked by [[Guggenheim]] when warning [[Dante Vale]] against the perilous mission of accepting [[the Professor]]'s invitation. Though Guggenheim feared so much for Dante and his team that fighting him was an option, Bulreguard simply greeted Dante by licking him. It was eventually agreed that Dante's team would follow their plan, although without [[Huntik Foundation|Foundation]] support. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}

Bulreguard once stole an uncovered bone from [[Montehue]] during a [[Huntik Foundation]] dig. {{source|TCG:SAS-033|SAS-033}}

Bulreguard later was invoked to assist alongside Dante's team in fighting against the multiplying [[Gremlow]] Titans infesting the [[Hamelin Cathedral]]. Using his Speak ability, Bulreguard was able to temporarily hold the swarming Gremlow at bay. {{source|Gremlow Infestation!}}
